{
  "id": "section-sanity",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0000",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Sanity\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,301,308]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0001",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Sanity is a measure of how\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,308,335]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0002",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "mentally sound you are. You lose\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,335,368]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0003",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Sanity by meeting supernatural\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,368,399]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0004",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "menaces and failing to help other\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,399,433]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0005",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "humans. You gain Sanity by resting\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,433,468]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0006",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "in calm places. If your Sanity goes\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,468,504]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0007",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to 0, you are overcome by insanity\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,504,539]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0008",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "and your game ends.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,539,559]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0009",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "You may at any moment prevent\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,559,589]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0010",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "the loss of 1 or 2 Sanity points by\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,589,625]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0011",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "rolling on the Insanity table. This\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,625,661]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0012",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "will give you a lasting Mental Scar\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,661,697]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0013",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "but will let you continue on playing.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,697,735]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0014",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "When you have 3 Mental Scars, you\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,735,769]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0015",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "may no longer roll on the Insanity\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,769,804]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0016",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "table and must accept any Sanity\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,804,837]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0017",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "loss you receive.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,837,855]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0018",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "Between games, Sanity is restored\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,855,889]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0019",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "to its maximum, but Mental Scars\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,889,922]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "section-sanity:p0020",
      "kind": "body",
      "text": "remain until the character’s death.\n",
      "sourceLocation": "pdf:spans:[[10,922,958]]"
    }
  ],
  "sourcePages": [
    10
  ]
}
